\begin{definition}
\label{def:8-60-extra-3}



A linear subspace $\mathfrak h\subseteq\mathfrak g$ is a \emph{Lie
subalgebra} if $[X,Y]\in\mathfrak h$ for all $X,Y\in\mathfrak h$; it then
inherits the restricted bracket.
\end{definition}

